#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.field_res_company__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_learn_vendor_code
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.field_res_config_settings__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_learn_vendor_code
msgid ""
"When a line of a CFDI is matched by hand with a purchase order line, keep "
"its code in the vendor pricelist of the product so the next CFDI with that "
"code is matched alone."
msgstr ""
"Cuando una línea de un CFDI se concilia a mano con una línea de orden de "
"compra, guardar su código en la tarifa del proveedor del producto para que "
"el siguiente CFDI con ese código se concilie solo."

#. module: l10n_mx_sat_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.selection__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_invoice_wizard__match_mode__document
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.selection__res_company__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_match_mode__document
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.selection__res_partner__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_match_mode__document
msgid "Whole CFDI"
msgstr "CFDI completo"

#. module: l10n_mx_sat_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.field_res_company__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_match_mode
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_mx_sat_purchase.field_res_config_settings__l10n_mx_sat_purchase_match_mode
msgid ""
"Whole CFDI: the bill takes everything pending to bill in the purchase orders.\n"
"By lines: each line of the CFDI is matched with the purchase order lines it bills, with its quantity.\n"
"A vendor can have its own value, and it can be changed when billing."
msgstr ""
"CFDI completo: la factura toma todo lo pendiente de facturar de las órdenes de compra.\n"
"Por líneas: cada línea del CFDI se concilia con las líneas de orden de compra que factura, con su cantidad.\n"
"Un proveedor puede tener su propio valor, y se puede cambiar al facturar."

